##LOCAL
### GET string Hello World test
GET http://localhost:3000

### GET all contact records from local database
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts

### GET contact by ID (add any contactid from the collection of MongoDB)
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts/6a9f683f09b49049f8d4ac40

### CREATE contact record (Local)
POST http://localhost:3000/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Matias",
    "lastName": "Gutierrez",
    "email": "matias@example.com",
    "favoriteColor": "Blue",
    "birthday": "1998-05-15"
}

### UPDATE contact record by ID (Local)
PUT http://localhost:3000/contacts/6a9f683f09b49049f8d4ac40
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Matias Updated",
    "lastName": "Gutierrez",
    "email": "matias.updated@example.com",
    "favoriteColor": "Green",
    "birthday": "1998-05-15"
}

### DELETE contact record by ID (Local)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/contacts/6a9f683f09b49049f8d4ac40




